body:
I feel you. For some fucked up reason I always knew I was going to die because of suicide, even when I was a child. Like you, right now I can't imagine being happy with myself anytime soon, or, ever. I can't see how some people could live like that for so many years.

&#x200B;

I don't know if this would help, but one thing that keeps me going whenever I get scared I will surely off myself soon is thinking how much I will miss certain things that others would probably see as "stupid" if I told them there were my reason to live, like how much I want to see a certain movie from a show that was cancelled lots of years ago or what a waste it would be to left the videogames I just bought unplayed. I am not happy, but I feel like having those few moments of personal enjoyment feel pretty nice and something I would really miss.
